// Title: Network Connection Initiated From Process Located In Potentially Suspicious Or Uncommon Location
// Rule ID: 7b434893-c57d-4f41-908d-6a17bf1ae98f
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.command-and-control, attack.t1105
// Category: network_connection
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: azure_monitor
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/network_connection/net_connection_win_susp_initiated_uncommon_or_suspicious_locations.yml
